<!-- backlog-viewer
version: 1
directory: ./backlog/
formatId: h1-heading
lineEnding: os
numberingScheme: alphanumeric
-->

<!--
  This is a pointer file for the Backlog Viewer VS Code extension.
  Open it in VS Code to see the visual backlog editor.

  Settings in the block above:
    directory      - relative path to the folder of .md item files
    formatId       - item format: h1-heading, h2-heading, bullet, paragraph, indentation
    lineEnding     - line ending convention: lf, crlf, or os (platform default)
    numberingScheme - file prefix style: numeric (0001, 0002) or alphanumeric (stable keys)

  You can edit these settings by hand. The extension re-reads them each time
  you open the file.
-->
